---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Andrei Shemetau"
  description="Privacy information for the Andrei Shemetau portfolio website."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: 1 November 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content">
      <h2>Who is responsible for this website</h2>
      <p>
        This portfolio is operated by Andrei Shemetau. For privacy questions or
        requests, contact{" "}
        <a href="mailto:andrei.shemetov@gmail.com">andrei.shemetov@gmail.com</a>
        .
      </p>

      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        With your consent, this website uses Google Analytics 4 to understand
        how visitors use the site and which content is useful. The legal basis
        for this processing is your consent. Analytics remains disabled until
        you select “Accept”.
      </p>
      <p>
        Analytics may process information such as pages viewed, approximate
        location, device and browser information, traffic source, and
        interactions such as contact-link clicks. This website does not
        intentionally send your name, email address, or other form contents to
        Google Analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google acts as an analytics service provider and may process data
        outside your country. For details, see{" "}
        <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Google’s Privacy Policy
        </a>
        .
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and storage</h2>
      <p>
        If you accept analytics, Google Analytics can set <code>_ga</code> and{" "}
        <code>_ga_*</code> first-party cookies. Their default lifetime is up to
        two years and may be renewed when you revisit the site. Your consent
        choice is stored in your browser under <code>analytics-consent</code> so
        the site can remember it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choice</h2>
      <p>
        You can decline analytics without losing access to the website. You can
        also change or withdraw your choice at any time using “Cookie settings”
        in the footer. Withdrawing consent disables future analytics collection
        and removes the Google Analytics cookies accessible to this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention and your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics data is retained according to the retention settings in the
        Google Analytics property. Depending on your location, you may have
        rights to access, correct, delete, restrict, or object to processing of
        personal data, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection
        authority. Contact the email address above to exercise a relevant right.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: var(--article-width);
  }

  .legal-page header {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 68px);
  }

  .legal-page .content a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
